+  - Output:
+```text
+running 9 tests
+test consolidation::review_queue_tests::decision_reason_column_round_trips ... ok
+test consolidation::review_queue_tests::repo_scope_proposal_is_gated_and_stays_pending ... ok
+test consolidation::review_queue_tests::organization_scope_proposal_is_gated_and_stays_pending ... ok
